message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Decision-model ratings of 8-K filings and short-term stock returns"
abstract: >-
  A decision model (Jev, from TypeSafe) rated 26,962 8-K filings by S&P 500
  companies, 2013 to 2026, from very bad to very good for shareholders. Within
  item group and year, the rating's rank correlation with the 2-day
  market-adjusted return is +0.025 (95% interval +0.015 to +0.034). Code,
  frozen designs, summary results and grading scripts.
type: software
